# Important Terms

| Term      | Meaning                                            |
| --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |
| Redis     | Fast NoSQL key-value database                      |
| Key       | Name used to store/retrieve data                   |
| Value     | Data stored inside a key                           |
| NoSQL     | Database type that does not use traditional tables |
| In-memory | Data stored mainly in RAM                          |
| redis-cli | Command-line tool for Redis                        |

